# Mahal — Morocco Venue Marketplace

**mahall.org** — connecting distinctive Moroccan venues with event planners, brands, and travellers.

Stack: WordPress 6.4+ · Custom HTML blocks · PHP plugin · Claude AI via Anthropic API

---

## Deployment in two commands

```bash
# After uploading files and adding API keys to wp-config.php:

./mahall-deploy.sh --path /var/www/mahall.org/public
# Creates pages, activates plugin, seeds taxonomy, exports venues.json (~60s)

./mahall-pages.sh --html-dir ./mahall-files --path /var/www/mahall.org/public
# Populates all 11 pages with their HTML block content (~30s)
```

See **mahall-deploy-v2.0.md** for the full manual deployment guide.

